# Backend research scope

## Default

Stay **inside the workspace** for normal C# / backend work.

## Outside the workspace

Searching outside the workspace (game assemblies, other repos, AppData, etc.) is allowed **only when the user explicitly requests** it.

Even then:

1. **Narrow first** using MCP linkages (kcs2m, kanban, project binders) to get concrete type / path / name targets.
2. Only then query the filesystem with that narrowed scope — no broad fishing expeditions.
